2026-03-21 20:49:54 [INFO]: [MONGO] products.insertOne - {"Product_ID":"PRD-MK-GLOSS-01","Parent_ID":"LINE-GLOSS","Category":"Makeup","Name":"Glowy Jelly Tint","Price":10,"Volume_Size":"15g","Is_Skincare":false,"Description_Short":"","Full_Description":"Drench your lips in 3D radiance.\n\nThe TIRTIR Glowy Jelly Tint is where high-shine gloss meets the endurance of a professional lip stain. Featuring a unique Jelly-Matrix System, it creates a high-gloss, \"syrup-coated\" finish that smooths over lip lines for a plump, flawless look. Infused with a 70% moisture-lock complex, it’s the ultimate hybrid for those who demand color that stays and shine that stuns.\n\nThe \"Lip Glaze\" Standard: The TIRTIR Glowy Jelly Tint is engineered for the \"High-Shine/Low-Maintenance\" lifestyle. Its specialized formula creates a bi-layer effect: a vibrant color layer that grips the lips and a crystal-clear \"jelly top-coat\" that rises to the surface to reflect light from every angle.\n\nSkincare-First Formulation: More than a tint, this is a volumizing lip treatment. It leverages a \"triple-oil\" blend and moisture-binding actives:\n\nBotanical Oil Trinity (Rosehip, Camellia, Meadowfoam): Deeply nourishes the delicate lip barrier to prevent seasonal peeling and dryness.\n\nAtelocollagen & Hydrolyzed Hyaluronic Acid: Works to \"fill\" the appearance of fine lines, giving the lips a youthful, pillowy texture.\n\nNon-Sticky Adhesion: Engineered to be \"chewy\" (쫀득)—it stays put during movement without the typical discomfort of traditional heavy glosses.\n\nThe Longevity: Even after the initial high-shine layer naturally wears off, it leaves behind a uniform, translucent stain that lasts for hours. No awkward \"lip rings\" or patchy fading—just a continuous, healthy flush of color.","How_To_Use":"","Thumbnail_Images":"/uploads/products/products-1774100942042-551888876.webp","Gallery_Images":[],"Description_Images":[],"Is_Best_Seller":false,"Rating_Average":0,"Rating_Count":0,"Sold_Quantity":0,"Category_Slug":"makeup","slug":"glowy-jelly-tint","Skin_Type_Target":"","Main_Concern":"","Status":"Active","Stock_Quantity":100,"Stock_Reserved":0,"views":0,"_id":"69bea20267300e2fc810e832","createdAt":"2026-03-21T13:49:54.987Z","updatedAt":"2026-03-21T13:49:54.987Z","__v":0}
